RO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_962941809770594_4918126426351310370_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cf57IeoHCesQ7kNvwHGu_Gx&_nc_oc=AdqXQOJDjo9_6vvoqseAOvx6KdQ_ske68wGepkHLuaBVJQLYM5LXeH7UH0Mnt3-vJrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX1dCfiwvATIjcdSznHvUl7D24-SkQo-We3ytvf6WVtCg&oe=6B105C78"}]}, "id": "1657224216077214", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screenshot_02_2560x1440.png", "id": "1745635586544950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1745635589878283_5460151183527169090_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c4nrYuI1QPwQ7kNvwEqzVs6&_nc_oc=AdqYihhzNK7YpwNmEqV8KW71DLolnwro9Vob05ok-AUSQtJm8Tk7bAwGMo4DDxEVb9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWyLIHsClFAN6vuZKCWMB-hvgH8ndKCkhNrY2V9aDyDAg&oe=6B104F91"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_03_2560x1440.png", "id": "1295695862685048", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1295695866018381_1776159790254652827_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BGiCkUVvzwwQ7kNvwGNTtNw&_nc_oc=AdrpY8NFAmKtOi1Rsd6K7pVkLOuqDK1DCiSJLHhlYj_bBCkGmjoP6qIWx_knvmWTcMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXdj0WIAYdh_p6AVJdt7dmQU3k6XK2MFAk4BSkApqsjvA&oe=6B103CD5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_01_2560x1440.png", "id": "992731576508537", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_992731583175203_2487512220027944981_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zjOS51XD5toQ7kNvwGDl88C&_nc_oc=AdrmEfu1aHKxK9jCG2VLf6ZXyN9qx2scRKXEL4xyOJyzN95Mt4d08dbSIsBdUS-Z9oA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW2RsaXLHnHOvQqDAkDTkYEQoNdqSxTrDlX3HR7jrSa1A&oe=6B104684"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_04_2560x1440.png", "id": "2635671120213705", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_2635671126880371_6183965583961069422_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BwDRTeaNESYQ7kNvwGTROfK&_nc_oc=Adp_nuAmMYrHE9UNKV4gFIhHIOEq4ERq7iP753wuHqwxc4WlzueS1NNunl0APisZXn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVfcr8i5ayqmZNbrJNwh0TrpLIw4I_aWsAoCd2cLWsBgQ&oe=6B106919"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_07_2560x1440.png", "id": "2692144114535375", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_2692144117868708_7912223150508098241_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Fzkv2-enNIQ7kNvwHZVEv6&_nc_oc=AdpiXfnj9dqmj4sysAUUyCGDpJczgvOIamldar2SxHpBAggpDonuZqguUIEjezK0K18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXCMIuhHnOHpApU02OPAwhhNCylQTqnbTmeJmgcObrUjA&oe=6B103A15"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1817245636198674", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_1817245639532007_8159436477001535337_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BzHhg6T_ZIAQ7kNvwGwetNv&_nc_oc=AdoSEH-54GqWVu_SN3Bm1qwfysJ5CIw5AyjWpr66dTEd-Y9chts9plTHUE95GwzG_44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV5ivqqbcOeIXU_6vUhHRi_t2MeripVKwboChP_XVrqFA&oe=6B10555B"}, "display_name": "Chess MR \u2013 Chess in Mixed Reality", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bring the chessboard into your world.\n\nChess MR places a full-size chess table right in your room thanks to Meta Quest passthrough. A virtual opponent sits in front of you, thinks about its moves and plays them by hand, just like a real game across the table.\n\n**Play naturally**\n- Pick up and move pieces with your hands (hand tracking) or with the controllers\n- Legal moves are highlighted as soon as you grab a piece\n- After each move, press your button on the chess clock to pass the turn, just like in a real tournament\n- Grab the golden handles to move and rotate the table wherever you like\n\n**A real opponent at your table**\n- A different animated opponent every game, each with their own name\n- Four levels: Easy, Medium, Hard and Master, the strongest, which thinks longer and sees further ahead\n- \"Check!\" and checkmate announced right on the board\n\n**300 puzzles to train with**\n- Mate in 1, 2 and 3, plus win-material exercises\n- Find the right move: if you get it wrong you can try again, and at the end you see how many mistakes you made\n- Stuck? Ask for the solution\n\n**Hints that explain why**\n- Ask for help and get the best move with a plain-language explanation: captures, threats, forks, checks, pieces to save, development and control of the centre\n- See the engine evaluation and play the suggested move with one tap\n- Up to 3 hints per game, so you learn without the game playing for you\n\n**Everything you need for a proper game**\n- Chess clock with 5, 10, 15, 30 minutes or n", "short_description": "lay chess on a real-size table in your own room. Challenge a virtual opponent, move the pieces with your hands, solve puzzles and learn with explained hints, from Easy to Master level."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1643584483927886", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chess MR \u2013 Ajedrez en Realidad Mixta", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Lleva el tablero a tu mundo.\n\nChess MR coloca una mesa de ajedrez a tama\u00f1o real en tu habitaci\u00f3n gracias al passthrough de Meta Quest. Frente a ti se sienta un rival virtual que piensa sus jugadas y las hace con la mano, como en una partida de verdad.\n \n**Juega de forma natural**\n- Coge y mueve las piezas con las manos (hand tracking) o con los mandos\n- Las jugadas v\u00e1lidas se resaltan en cuanto agarras una pieza\n- Despu\u00e9s de cada jugada, pulsa tu bot\u00f3n del reloj para pasar el turno, como en un torneo de verdad\n- Agarra las asas doradas para mover y girar la mesa donde quieras\n\n**Un rival de verdad en tu mesa**\n- Un rival animado distinto en cada partida, cada uno con su propio nombre\n- Cuatro niveles: F\u00e1cil, Medio, Dif\u00edcil y Maestro, el m\u00e1s fuerte, que piensa m\u00e1s tiempo y ve m\u00e1s lejos\n- \"\u00a1Jaque!\" y jaque mate anunciados directamente en el tablero\n\n**300 problemas para entrenar**\n- Mate en 1, 2 y 3 jugadas y ejercicios para ganar material\n- Encuentra la jugada correcta: si te equivocas puedes volver a intentarlo, y al final sabes cu\u00e1ntos errores has cometido\n- \u00bfTe has atascado? Pide la soluci\u00f3n\n\n**Sugerencias que te explican el porqu\u00e9**\n- Pide ayuda y descubre la mejor jugada con una explicaci\u00f3n en palabras: capturas, amenazas, ataques dobles, jaques, piezas que poner a salvo, desarrollo y control del centro\n- Consulta tambi\u00e9n la evaluaci\u00f3n del motor y juega la jugada sugerida con un toque\n- Hasta 3 sugerencias por partida: para aprender sin que el juego juegue por ti\n\n", "short_description": "Juega al ajedrez en una mesa a tama\u00f1o real en tu propia habitaci\u00f3n. Desaf\u00eda a un rival virtual, mueve las piezas con las manos, resuelve 300 problemas y aprende con sugerencias explicadas, del nivel F\u00e1cil al Maestro."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "2195188414400961", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_2195188417734294_596423064916289573_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FifVQC4Xx30Q7kNvwGo3cIe&_nc_oc=Ado82Gv4L6ZPuTHnpMsywA7BuQVRe3BHWsMjmv0TjN0vXNlVJknq-vNHK7D3dR6Q-MU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU3WYaRArBa8fi-YekhcRtLTRyWSAbK6GQWTPsZk99Dxg&oe=6B1048FC"}, {"file_name": "icon_512_anteprima.png", "id": "1753434859077955", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_BACKGROU